Cancel a shift as "cancelled by the client": the shift stays billable and
every client on it is marked absent. Use when the client cancelled.

REQUIRED CONFIRMATION before calling: read the shift back to the user —
"Cancel shift #[shift ID] on [date/time] for client(s) [names] with staff [names]?
The client(s) will be marked absent and the shift remains billable."
Only call after the user explicitly confirms.

Required: id, absent_reason — an NDIS no-show code, one of NSDH
(health), NSDF (family), NSDT (unavailable transport), NSDO (other).
Do not send cancel_reason.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__shiftcare_au__cancel_shift_with_charge(args: {
  // NDIS no-show code recorded against each client; every client is marked absent and the shift stays billable. One of: NSDH (no show due to health), NSDF (no show due to family), NSDT (no show due to unavailable transport), NSDO (other).
  absent_reason: "NSDH" | "NSDF" | "NSDT" | "NSDO";
  // ID of the shift to cancel.
  id: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

